        "subject": "Recordatorio Sesión Grupal",
        "bodyContent": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 20px 0;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n          \n          <!-- Header con Logo -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #2d2d2d 100%); padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n              <img src=\"https://cantera.digital/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cantera-logo-slide.svg#25\" alt=\"Cantera Digital\" style=\"max-width: 200px; height: auto;\" />\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          \n          <!-- Banner Recordatorio -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #E94268; padding: 20px; text-align: center;\">\n              <h1 style=\"margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600;\">\n                🔔 Recordatorio de Sesión Grupal\n              </h1>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          \n          <!-- Contenido Principal -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 40px 30px;\">\n              <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 20px 0; color: #1a1a1a; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600;\">\n                ¡Hola {{$json.nombre}}! 👋\n              </h2>\n              \n              <p style=\"margin: 0 0 25px 0; color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                Te recordamos que tienes una <strong style=\"color: #E94268;\">sesión grupal programada para mañana</strong>. Esta es una excelente oportunidad para aprender y conectar con otros participantes.\n              </p>\n              \n              <!-- Detalles de la Sesión -->\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f8f8f8; border-left: 4px solid #E94268; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 25px;\">\n                    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 15px;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #888888; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">📅 Fecha</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 20px; color: #1a1a1a; font-weight: 600;\">{{$json.dia}}</p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 15px;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #888888; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">🕐 Hora</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 20px; color: #1a1a1a; font-weight: 600;\">{{$json.hora}} hrs</p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-top: 10px;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #888888; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">🔗 Acceso a la Sesión</p>\n                          <a href=\"{{$json.url}}\" style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #E94268; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; transition: background-color 0.3s;\">\n                            Unirse a la Sesión →\n                          </a>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n              \n              <p style=\"margin: 25px 0 0 0; color: #4a4a4a; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                <strong>💡 Recomendación:</strong> Te sugerimos unirte unos minutos antes para verificar tu conexión y audio.\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          \n          <!-- Footer -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color: #1a1a1a; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n              <p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14px;\">\n                ¡Nos vemos en la sesión! 🚀\n              </p>\n              <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #888888; font-size: 13px;\">\n                <strong style=\"color: #E94268;\">Equipo Cantera Digital</strong><br>\n                Transformando ideas en soluciones inteligentes\n              </p>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          \n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "additionalFields": {
          "bodyContentType": "html"
        }
      },
